        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 23, \"total_count\": 23, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created listing 'Upcycled Bamboo Plant Stand' with 2 photos, description, price $48, category Home Decor, condition Like New, location Seattle WA, upcycled=true. Detail page displays all submitted info correctly including Upcycled badge, seller Seller Sam, listed date 2026-08-26.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No edit functionality exposed for existing listings\", \"actual\": \"My Listings page only exposes View, Mark Sold, and Delete actions per listing (no Edit button). The listing detail page for the owner's own listing shows no edit affordance either - only 'Manage Your Listings' link, image prev/next, and thumbnail selectors. There is no way found in the UI to edit title, description, photos, price, category, condition, location, or upcycled status of an existing listing.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Mark Sold toggled status from Active->Sold immediately, button became 'Mark Available', toggling again reverted to Active. Delete opened a confirmation dialog ('Delete listing?' with Cancel/Delete), confirming removed the listing immediately - My Listings shows 'No listings yet'.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"'Sold Test Sofa' (marked Sold) and 'Delete Test Lamp' (deleted) both return '0 items available'/'No items found' when searched in browse. Sold item's detail page shows 'This item is no longer available' with no Add to Cart / purchase request controls, instead of buy actions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered with name/email/password(12chars)/location; redirected to home with header showing Sell, Cart, My Profile, My Listings, Log out - user is signed in.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined category(Furniture)+condition(New)+upcycled-only+price-min filters correctly narrowed 10->2->1 results, each matching all criteria. Sort by Price Low-to-High produced ascending price order (35,45,55...320). Sort by Distance reordered results. Distance filter reduced to 2 miles correctly excluded all items (0 available), confirming distance filtering works.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search 'VINTAGE' (uppercase) matched 2 items containing 'Vintage' in title (case-insensitive). Search 'portland' (lowercase) matched 3 items with 'Portland, OR' location. Clearing search restored all 10 items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged in as Marcus Chen (marcus@example.com). Viewed prod-1 'Mid-Century Modern Armchair' (owned by seller Emma Green, not Marcus), clicked Add to Cart. Navigated to /cart: cart shows 1 item, title 'Mid-Century Modern Armchair', photo thumbnail, location 'Brooklyn, NY', price $285, and cart total $285.00 - all correct/matching product detail page.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Marcus Chen (buyer), on prod-1 (seller Emma Green, not owned by Marcus) sent a non-empty message via 'Message Seller' dialog ('Hi Emma, I'd like to purchase this armchair...') and got toast 'Message sent to seller!'. Then added item to cart and clicked 'Send Purchase Request': toast 'Purchase requests sent to sellers!' appeared and cart cleared to 0 items - clear visible confirmation of purchase request submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category selection from /categories page does not filter browse results\", \"actual\": \"On /categories page, Furniture category card showed '3 items'. Clicking it navigated to /?category=furniture, but the browse grid displayed all 10 items (browse.count = '10 items available') including non-furniture items (e.g. Yoga Mat, Headphones, Book Set, Denim Jacket). The Furniture filter checkbox (browse.filters.categories.item.furniture) remained unchecked (value:false), confirming the category filter was not actually applied. Expected only the 3 furniture listings to display with a matching count.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Seller has no way to view purchase requests or buyer messages\", \"actual\": \"As buyer Sofia, sent a message ('Hi Marcus, I love this jacket...') via Message Seller dialog and then submitted a purchase request (toast 'Purchase requests sent to sellers!') for prod-2 (Vintage Denim Jacket, owned by seller Marcus Chen). Logged out and logged back in as Marcus Chen (the seller) and checked /my-listings (only shows title/price/status/View/Mark Sold/Delete, no requests or messages indicator) and the user menu (only 'My Profile' and 'My Listings' links, no Requests/Messages/Orders/Inbox option). /profile route returns a 404 'Page not found'. There is no UI anywhere for the seller to view the requested item or the buyer's message - the feature does not exist.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with unregistered email nonexistent.user.qa@example.com shows toast 'Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com', stays on /login, no authenticated session (header still shows Log in/Sign up after).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate email (case-variation) accepted at registration\", \"actual\": \"Registering with 'Timothee.Tester.QA@example.com' (case-variation of already-registered 'timothee.tester.qa@example.com') succeeded with toast 'Account created successfully!' and created a second account 'Duplicate Tester', instead of being rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Incorrect password accepted; authentication does not verify password\", \"actual\": \"Logging in as timothee.tester.qa@example.com with password 'wrongpassword' (registered password was 'password123') succeeded: redirected to home page and authenticated as Timothee Tester with full signed-in header (Sell, Cart, user menu showing name/email, My Profile, My Listings, Log out).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Marcus Chen, /my-listings shows only his own listings (prod-2, prod-6) each with 'Mark Sold'/'Delete' seller-management controls. Viewing prod-1 (owned by Emma Green, not Marcus) on the product detail page showed only 'Add to Cart' and 'Message Seller' actions - no Mark Sold/Delete controls were present, confirming seller-management actions are scoped to the owning seller only.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting empty form triggers native 'Please fill out this field' validation on Title/Description/Price. After filling title, description, price, category, condition, location but leaving photos empty, submit shows toast 'Please add at least one image' and listing is not created (form remains on create-listing page).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is HTML type=number with min=0 step=0.01; typing non-numeric text 'abc' is rejected by the browser (cannot be entered). Entering -15 and submitting a fully-completed form did not create a listing (My Listings remained empty, no navigation away from form) - negative price silently blocked from creating a listing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged out; clicked heart/wishlist icon on browse card (no-op, no auth required, likely favorite toggle not cart). Then navigated to /product/prod-1 and clicked 'Add to Cart' (product.add-to-cart) while unauthenticated: app redirected to /login page (URL changed to http://localhost:6023/login, login form rendered). Confirms unauthenticated cart action is blocked with a clear sign-in redirect.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No duplicate-account feedback shown; registration succeeded instead of being blocked\", \"actual\": \"Attempting to register an already-used email (case-variant) produced a success toast 'Account created successfully!' and navigated away from the registration form to the home page, rather than showing duplicate-account feedback and keeping the form available.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into search box immediately updated result count and list (e.g. 10->2 for 'VINTAGE', ->3 for 'portland') without any separate submit action; clearing the box immediately restored 10 items available.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each filter/sort change (category checkbox, condition checkbox, upcycled toggle, price slider, distance slider, sort dropdown) immediately updated result count and list without a submit action. 'Clear all filters' immediately restored the full unfiltered 10-item set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking 'Add to Cart' on product detail page immediately updated header cart icon badge from empty to '1' (header.cart.count) without any page reload or navigate call. Subsequent in-app navigation to /cart confirmed the line item and total were already correctly reflected, no manual refresh needed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual